{{!< default}}

<h1>The Democracy Network</h1>

{{> "signup"}}

<h2>Who we are</h2>
<p>We are a network of democracy practitioners, organisers, researchers and professionals committed to developing and
  defending democratic society.</p>

<h2>What we do</h2>
<p>The Democracy Network connects, strengthens and champions a dynamic network of people and civil society organisations
  working to strengthen and advance democracy in the UK.</p>

<ul class="cards" role="list">
  <li>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Networking</h3>
      <p>We build spaces and opportunities for democracy practitioners to learn from each other, build trust and
        develop strategies together.</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Ecosystem</h3>
      <p>We provide access to shared resources, skills and intelligence

        More asset based approach etc, hubs stuff</p>
    </div>
  </li>
  <li>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Infrastructure</h3>
      <p>We provide access to a shared information layer, combining resources, skills and intelligence - through which
        people working to strengthen democracy can better develop a sense of the field, their role and opportunities
        within it.</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>

<h2>Latest bulletins</h2>
{{#get "posts" limit="3" filter="tag:bulletin" as |latest|}}
  <ul class="cards" role="list">
    {{#foreach latest}}
      <li>{{> "bulletin-card"}}</li>
    {{/foreach}}
  </ul>
{{else}}
  <p>No bulletins yet.</p>
{{/get}}

<p><a class="button button--secondary" href="/bulletin/">See all bulletins</a></p>

